==Battleground==
*3 [[Relic Doge]]s spawn after 6.67 seconds<sup>200f</sup>, delay 16.67~20 seconds<sup>500f~600f</sup>.
*1 [[One Horn]] spawns after 6.67 seconds<sup>200f</sup>.
*4 [[Ginger Snache]]s spawn after 10 seconds<sup>300f</sup>, delay 13.33~16.67 seconds<sup>400f~500f</sup>.
*Infinite [[Mistress Celeboodle]]s spawn after 16.67 seconds<sup>500f</sup>, delay 66.67~70 seconds<sup>2,000f~2,100f</sup>.
*When the base reaches 99% HP:
**1 [[Cumulus Gallus]] spawns as the boss.
**4 [[Suidae Piggicus|Suidae Piggici]] spawn, delay 30~33.33 seconds<sup>900f~1,000f</sup>.
**3 [[Ursamajor]]s spawn, delay 43.33~46.67 seconds<sup>1,300f~1,400f</sup>.
**7 [[Relic Doge]]s spawn, delay 13.33~16.67 seconds<sup>400f~500f</sup>.
**4 [[Ginger Snache]]s spawn, delay 20~23.33 seconds<sup>600f~700f</sup>.
**Infinite [[Relic Doge]]s spawn after 3.33 seconds<sup>100f</sup>, delay 20~23.33 seconds<sup>600f~700f</sup>.
**7 [[Ginger Snache]]s spawn after 3.33 seconds<sup>100f</sup>, delay 23.33~26.67 seconds<sup>700f~800f</sup>.
**Infinite [[Relic Doge]]s spawn after 6.67 seconds<sup>200f</sup>, delay 30~33.33 seconds<sup>900f~1,000f</sup>.
**Infinite [[Ginger Snache]]s spawn after 6.67 seconds<sup>200f</sup>, delay 30~33.33 seconds<sup>900f~1,000f</sup>.

==Strategy==
A couple of meatshields and the usual [[Ancient Egg: N101 (Rare Cat)|Courier Cat]] with Research [[Cat Combo]]s are enough to deal with the enemies. Bringing UL Legend [[True Form]]s can both help here and in the continuation stage (though keep in mind that [[Urs & Fenrir (Special Cat)|Urs]] and [[Elder Mask Doron (Special Cat)|Doron]] don't work well in the continuation stage).

